{"parents": [{"link": "../", "title": "Raw Types"}], "prev": {"link": "../secure-secret-settings/", "title": "SecureSecretSettings"}, "next": {"link": "../secure-value-error/", "title": "SecureValueError"}, "title": "SecureValue", "meta": {}, "body": "<section id=\"securevalue\">\n<h1>SecureValue<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#securevalue\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h1>\n<dl class=\"py class\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"pyrogram.raw.types.SecureValue\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">pyrogram.raw.types.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">SecureValue</span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#pyrogram.raw.types.SecureValue\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Telegram API type.</p>\n<p>Constructor of <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../../base/secure-value/#pyrogram.raw.base.SecureValue\" title=\"pyrogram.raw.base.SecureValue\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">SecureValue</span></code></a>.</p>\n<dl class=\"simple\">\n<dt>Details:</dt><dd><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p>Layer: <code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">222</span></code></p></li>\n<li><p>ID: <code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">187FA0CA</span></code></p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>type</strong> (<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../../base/secure-value-type/#pyrogram.raw.base.SecureValueType\" title=\"pyrogram.raw.base.SecureValueType\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">SecureValueType</span></code></a>) \u2013 N/A</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>hash</strong> (<code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">bytes</span></code>) \u2013 N/A</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>data</strong> (<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../../base/secure-data/#pyrogram.raw.base.SecureData\" title=\"pyrogram.raw.base.SecureData\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">SecureData</span></code></a>, <em>optional</em>) \u2013 N/A</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>front_side</strong> (<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../../base/secure-file/#pyrogram.raw.base.SecureFile\" title=\"pyrogram.raw.base.SecureFile\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">SecureFile</span></code></a>, <em>optional</em>) \u2013 N/A</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>reverse_side</strong> (<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../../base/secure-file/#pyrogram.raw.base.SecureFile\" title=\"pyrogram.raw.base.SecureFile\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">SecureFile</span></code></a>, <em>optional</em>) \u2013 N/A</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>selfie</strong> (<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../../base/secure-file/#pyrogram.raw.base.SecureFile\" title=\"pyrogram.raw.base.SecureFile\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">SecureFile</span></code></a>, <em>optional</em>) \u2013 N/A</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>translation</strong> (List of <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../../base/secure-file/#pyrogram.raw.base.SecureFile\" title=\"pyrogram.raw.base.SecureFile\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">SecureFile</span></code></a>, <em>optional</em>) \u2013 N/A</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>files</strong> (List of <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../../base/secure-file/#pyrogram.raw.base.SecureFile\" title=\"pyrogram.raw.base.SecureFile\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">SecureFile</span></code></a>, <em>optional</em>) \u2013 N/A</p></li>\n<li><p><s